%%label II. Assez vif, très rythmé
%%note A minor. A scherzo with the strings plucked, cross-rhythms of three against two, and a slow bowed middle section for cor anglais.
X:1
T:Ravel’s Missing Symphony
T:II. Assez vif, très rythmé
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Maurice Ravel
M:6/8
L:1/8
Q:"Assez vif" 3/8=126
%%score [fl ob eh cl bn] [hn tpt] harp cel [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:fl clef=treble name="Fl. I, II"
V:ob clef=treble name="Ob. I, II"
V:eh clef=treble name="C. A."
V:cl clef=treble name="Cl. I, II"
V:bn clef=bass name="Bn. I, II"
V:hn clef=treble name="Hn. I–IV"
V:tpt clef=treble name="Tpt. I, II"
V:harp clef=treble name="Harp"
V:cel clef=treble name="Cel."
V:v1 clef=treble name="Vl. I"
V:v2 clef=treble name="Vl. II"
V:va clef=alto name="Vla."
V:vc clef=bass name="Vc."
V:cb clef=bass name="Cb."
K:Am
V:fl
